      <title>Nvidia to Buy Hugging Face for $13B | Bloomberg Businessweek Daily 9/3/2026</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-09-03/bloomberg-businessweek-daily-9-3-2026-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">83d4603d4ef17c0ffbab0fd0</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:13:51 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Nvidia agreed to acquire artificial intelligence startup Hugging Face in a transaction valued at about $13 billion, adding a popular software platform to the chip giant’s AI empire. The price includes an equity-based retention program of as much as $1 billion for Hugging Face employees who join Nvidia, according to a statement Thursday. Bloomberg News AI reporter Rachel Metz discussed the acquisition and Bloomberg Tech Host Ed Ludlow discussed his interview with Hugging Face Co-Founder Thomas Wolf. Plus, Jason Tyler, President of Northern Trust Wealth Management talked about the private credit market. Finally, Randall Williams, Bloomberg News Senior Sports Reporter discussed the NBA's suspension of Steve Ballmer. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
